{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794544776826,"sessionID":"ses_e2ccd29cbffeOwNLR1Qo8Fv8oA","part":{"partID":"prt_1d3342d67001nTc8hDki1mmqG4","sessionID":"ses_e2ccd29cbffeOwNLR1Qo8Fv8oA","messageID":"msg_1d334245b001iGCCjTlL5hGKb6","type":"tool","id":"call_0462aac424e64ef58114d483","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/skill-advisor-hook.md","oldString":"The ambiguous head applies the same label to both sides: `Advisor: <freshness>; ambiguous: <label> <confidence>/<uncertainty> vs <label> <confidence>/<uncertainty> pass.` Each label part passes `sanitizeSkillLabel`, so a control character, a line break or an instruction-shaped label renders nothing rather than reaching the model. The `Also:` line still names a doctor command by its runnable string.\n\n### Degraded contract","newString":"The ambiguous head applies the same label to both sides: `Advisor: <freshness>; ambiguous: <label> <confidence>/<uncertainty> vs <label> <confidence>/<uncertainty> pass.` Each label part passes `sanitizeSkillLabel`, so a control character, a line break or an instruction-shaped label renders nothing rather than reaching the model. The `Also:` line still names a doctor command by its runnable string.\n\nA hub whose compiled route defers or asks to clarify, and whose modes have commands, renders as `<hub> (needs a mode)` with no command, for example:\n\n```text\nAdvisor: live; use system-deep-loop (needs a mode) 0.82/0.20 pass.\n```\n\nThe recommendation carries `needsMode: true`. A command on the same recommendation wins and the label is dropped.\n\n### Degraded contract"},"output":"Edited .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/skill-advisor-hook.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/skill-advisor-hook.md","patch":"Index: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/skill-advisor-hook.md\n===================================================================\n--- .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/skill-advisor-hook.md\n+++ .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/skill-advisor-hook.md\n@@ -59,8 +59,16 @@\n ```\n \n The ambiguous head applies the same label to both sides: `Advisor: <freshness>; ambiguous: <label> <confidence>/<uncertainty> vs <label> <confidence>/<uncertainty> pass.` Each label part passes `sanitizeSkillLabel`, so a control character, a line break or an instruction-shaped label renders nothing rather than reaching the model. The `Also:` line still names a doctor command by its runnable string.\n \n+A hub whose compiled route defers or asks to clarify, and whose modes have commands, renders as `<hub> (needs a mode)` with no command, for example:\n+\n+```text\n+Advisor: live; use system-deep-loop (needs a mode) 0.82/0.20 pass.\n+```\n+\n+The recommendation carries `needsMode: true`. A command on the same recommendation wins and the label is dropped.\n+\n ### Degraded contract\n \n When the daemon is unreachable, the CLI runs the local Python scorer and returns `status: ok` with `degraded: true` and `source: local-scorer`. The local scorer returns command row ids, which a reader cannot type, so the CLI rewrites each row before the brief renders:\n \n","status":"modified","additions":8,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/skill-advisor-hook.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/skill-advisor-hook.md\",\"oldString\":\"The ambiguous head applies the same label to both sides: `Advisor: <freshness>; ambiguous: <label> <confidence>/<uncertainty> vs <label> <confidence>/<uncertainty> pass.` Each label part passes `sanitizeSkillLabel`, so a control character, a line break or an instruction-shaped label renders nothing rather than reaching the model. The `Also:` line still names a doctor command by its runnable string.\\n\\n### Degraded contract\",\"newString\":\"The ambiguous head applies the same label to both sides: `Advisor: <freshness>; ambiguous: <label> <confidence>/<uncertainty> vs <label> <confidence>/<uncertainty> pass.` Each label part passes `sanitizeSkillLabel`, so a control character, a line break or an instruction-shaped label renders nothing rather than reaching the model. The `Also:` line still names a doctor command by its runnable string.\\n\\nA hub whose compiled route defers or asks to clarify, and whose modes have commands, renders as `<hub> (needs a mode)` with no command, for example:\\n\\n```text\\nAdvisor: live; use system-deep-loop (needs a mode) 0.82/0.20 pass.\\n```\\n\\nThe recommendation carries `needsMode: true`. A command on the same recommendation wins and the label is dropped.\\n\\n### Degraded contract\"}"},"time":{"start":1794544774503,"end":1794544776826}}}}
